        {
          "name": "Render",
          "description": "Fraction of wall time the render engine(s) spent executing work, from the i915/xe PMU. This is occupancy, not efficiency: an engine at 100% had work queued, which does not mean the execution units were saturated — read it alongside the frequency charts. Summing several engines of one class can exceed 100%, since they run concurrently.",
